llery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/denmark_hey_jude/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"196\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_hey_jude-200x196.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Hey Jude single artwork - Denmark\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_hey_jude-200x196.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_hey_jude-580x567.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_hey_jude-960x939.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_hey_jude-768x751.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_hey_jude-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_hey_jude.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9258\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/denmark_hey_jude/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_hey_jude.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,978\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Hey Jude single artwork \u2013 Denmark\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/denmark_hey_jude-960x939.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/spain_hey_jude/'><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_hey_jude-200x197.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Hey Jude single artwork - Spain\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_hey_jude-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_hey_jude-580x571.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_hey_jude-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_hey_jude.jpg 717w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10072\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/spain_hey_jude/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_hey_jude.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"717,706\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Hey Jude single artwork \u2013 Spain\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/spain_hey_jude.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_hey_jude/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"196\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_hey_jude-200x196.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Hey Jude single artwork - Japan\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_hey_jude-200x196.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_hey_jude-580x568.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_hey_jude-960x941.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_hey_jude-768x753.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_hey_jude-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_hey_jude.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9572\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/japan_hey_jude/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_hey_jude.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,980\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Hey Jude single artwork \u2013 Japan\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/japan_hey_jude-960x941.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_hey_jude/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_hey_jude-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Hey Jude single artwork - Brazil\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_hey_jude-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_hey_jude-580x574.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_hey_jude-960x949.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_hey_jude-768x760.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_hey_jude-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_hey_jude.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9180\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/brazil_hey_jude/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_hey_jude.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,989\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Hey Jude single artwork \u2013 Brazil\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/brazil_hey_jude-960x949.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/sweden_hey_jude/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_hey_jude-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Hey Jude single artwork - Norway, Sweden\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_hey_jude-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_hey_jude-580x576.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_hey_jude-960x953.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_hey_jude-768x763.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_hey_jude-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_hey_jude.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10127\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/sweden_hey_jude/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_hey_jude.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,993\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Hey Jude single artwork \u2013 Norway, Sweden\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/sweden_hey_jude-960x953.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><p><a href=\"/1968/07/30/recording-mixing-hey-jude/\">The next evening</a> The Beatles continued working on the track, recording takes 7-23. George Harrison played guitar on some early takes, but spent much of the session in the studio control room. The recording was filmed for a documentary by the National Music Council of Great Britain, who captured the group playing and chatting for a short colour film called <em>Music!</em>.</p><p>At the end of the session <a href=\"/people/george-martin/\">George Martin</a> made a rough mix of the song, in order to score it for the orchestra which was booked for <a href=\"/1968/08/01/recording-hey-jude-3/\">1 August</a>.</p><blockquote><div>&#8216;Hey Jude&#8217; has become a classic. It felt good recording it. We put it down a couple of times \u2013 trying to get it right \u2013 and, like everything else, it just clicked. That&#8217;s how it should be.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Ringo Starr<br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/anthologypb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Anthology</em></a></div><p><a href=\"/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-hey-jude_03/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-108814\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iNTM1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDUzNSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"108814\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/lyrics/lyrics-hey-jude_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1520,1016\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&amp;#8217;s handwritten lyrics for Hey Jude\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_03-960x642.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_03-960x642.jpg\" alt=\"Paul McCartney&#039;s handwritten lyrics for Hey Jude\" width=\"800\" height=\"535\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-108814\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_03-960x642.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_03-580x388.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_03-200x134.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_03-768x513.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/lyrics-hey-jude_03.jpg 1520w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a></p><p>On <a href=\"/1968/07/31/recording-hey-jude-2/\">31 July 1968</a> The Beatles decamped to Trident, an independent studio on London&#8217;s Wardour Street which had eight-track recording facilities. They began re-recording &#8216;Hey Jude&#8217;, laying down four takes of the song&#8217;s rhythm track.</p><blockquote><div>There is an amusing story about recording it. We were at Trident Studios in Soho, and Ringo walked out to go to the toilet and I hadn&#8217;t noticed. The toilet was only a few yards from his drum booth, but he&#8217;d gone past my back and I still thought he was in his drum booth. I started what was the actual take, and &#8216;Hey Jude&#8217; goes on for hours before the drums come in and while I was doing it I suddenly felt Ringo tiptoeing past my back rather quickly, trying to get to his drums. And just as he got to his drums, boom boom boom, his timing was absolutely impeccable. So I think when those things happen, you have a little laugh and a light bulb goes off in your head and you think, This is the take! And you put a little more into it. You think, oh, f**k! This has got to be the take, what just happened was so magic! So we did that and we made a pretty good record.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Paul McCartney<br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/manyyearsfromnow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Many Years From Now</em></a>, Barry Miles</div><p>The song was completed <a href=\"/1968/08/01/recording-hey-jude-3/\">the next day</a>. McCartney added his bass and lead vocals, and the other Beatles contributed backing vocals. The 36-strong orchestra then added backing for the lengthy four-chord coda. The classical musicians were also offered a double fee for clapping and singing along to the &#8216;nah nah nah&#8217; chant.</p><blockquote><div>Most of the musicians were happy to oblige, especially as it meant a doubled fee, but there was one dissenter who reportedly walked out, saying &#8220;I&#8217;m not going to clap my hands and sing Paul McCartney&#8217;s bloody song!&#8221;</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\"><em>The Complete Beatles Recording Sessions</em><br />\nMark Lewisohn</div><p>&#8216;Hey Jude&#8217; contains an unedited expletive, which is often played by radio stations to this day. In the final verse, John Lennon sang &#8220;Let her into&#8221; instead of &#8220;Let her under your skin&#8221;. His cry of &#8220;Oh!&#8221;, followed by &#8220;F*****g hell&#8221;, remains in the final mix.</p><blockquote><div>I was told about it at the time but could never hear it. But once I had it pointed out I can&#8217;t miss it now. I have a sneaking suspicion they knew all along, as it was a track that should have been pulled out in the mix. I would imagine it was one of those things that happened \u2013 it was a mistake, they listened to it and thought, &#8216;doesn&#8217;t matter, it&#8217;s fine&#8217;.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">Ken Scott, engineer<br />\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/lewisohnsessions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>The Complete Beatles Recording Sessions</em></a>, Mark Lewisohn</div><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/hey-jude/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></span> <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/hey-jude/3/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">3</span></a></div>",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-10-25"
